-- This is the load-bearing half. Tenant isolation is not enforced in application code - it is
-- the tenant_app role being NOBYPASSRLS plus these policies. A restore that recreated the
-- tables and skipped this section would look correct and be wide open.
-- --------------------------------------------------------------------------

